WEBVTT

00:07.256 --> 00:11.249
Didn't you say that you wanted to
see that wind user guy?

00:14.397 --> 00:15.659
I'll take you to him.

00:27.410 --> 00:29.071
What're you doing, Shiel?

00:29.912 --> 00:30.776
Let's go!

00:32.615 --> 00:33.377
Hold it!

00:33.482 --> 00:35.541
Thunder Wall Formation!

00:47.196 --> 00:49.187
Where are you going?

00:56.472 --> 00:57.370
Pairon...

00:58.874 --> 01:01.900
You really care about the Maiden,
don't you...

01:02.912 --> 01:04.971
...Shiel Messiah.

01:10.619 --> 01:12.985
Go back to your room now.

01:13.489 --> 01:18.051
Then I'll consider sparing the life
of Shiel Messiah.

01:18.394 --> 01:19.361
Life?

01:19.462 --> 01:22.863
I think you're the one who should
be worried about his life.

01:24.033 --> 01:26.593
I'm not talking to you.

01:27.136 --> 01:29.263
Just be quiet.

01:30.106 --> 01:30.868
Well?

01:31.440 --> 01:32.805
Maiden of Life?

01:34.910 --> 01:40.075
If you simply agree to return,
this girl's life will be spared.

01:41.250 --> 01:43.309
That's not a bad deal.

01:45.955 --> 01:48.253
Is that all you have to say?

01:48.491 --> 01:51.153
Now, how about we get things started.

01:52.128 --> 01:54.187
You really are just a kid...

01:54.830 --> 01:57.822
I wouldn't underestimate this kid...

01:58.501 --> 01:59.661
...old man.

02:16.852 --> 02:20.413
The city at night is so cold

02:20.489 --> 02:24.152
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

02:24.226 --> 02:27.627
I wonder if I can keep going

02:27.696 --> 02:30.028
The important thing...

02:30.366 --> 02:32.459
You must tell me

02:32.535 --> 02:34.162
Please

02:34.370 --> 02:39.273
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

02:39.341 --> 02:44.301
Tell me that's not true

02:44.747 --> 02:48.615
I loved you so much that it hurt

02:48.684 --> 02:52.142
Everything was sparkling all around

02:52.221 --> 02:55.520
There was nothing to be afraid of

02:55.591 --> 02:59.288
I believed in that

02:59.361 --> 03:02.990
That moment when
my passions stirred

03:03.065 --> 03:06.557
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

03:06.635 --> 03:09.832
I will never forget that moment

03:09.905 --> 03:13.705
I will never say I want to go back

03:13.776 --> 03:19.806
I just want to see you one more time

03:32.561 --> 03:35.598
The Promise of the Ribbons
The Promise of the Ribbons.

03:35.598 --> 03:40.126
The Promise of the Ribbons

03:40.803 --> 03:42.100
I'll ask you again!

03:42.171 --> 03:43.695
Where is the Company?!

03:45.274 --> 03:49.040
For someone who has nowhere to go,
you sure have a bad attitude.

03:49.245 --> 03:50.906
Forget about that!

03:51.180 --> 03:54.115
We're in a big hurry!

03:54.183 --> 03:56.481
Now, now. Take it easy.

03:56.552 --> 03:58.486
How can I take it easy?!

03:58.587 --> 03:59.713
Listen!

03:59.855 --> 04:04.189
The Company has a plan to take
revenge on the surface world...

04:04.260 --> 04:05.955
...by using Ruri's powers!

04:06.028 --> 04:11.193
So I've got to rescue Ruri
as soon as I can!

04:12.701 --> 04:16.228
Never mind the way you've
been addressing the Maiden.

04:16.305 --> 04:19.604
Do you think anyone is going to
believe what you're saying?

04:21.210 --> 04:23.110
Are you saying that I'm lying?

04:23.379 --> 04:28.078
I know the Company
much better than you do.

04:28.584 --> 04:31.610
After all, we are Company employees.

04:31.687 --> 04:34.781
Then wake up Blondie
and find out for yourself!

04:35.925 --> 04:37.688
B-Blondie...?

04:40.796 --> 04:43.094
How dare you call
Miss Rorec that!

04:43.165 --> 04:45.531
Who do you think you are?!

04:45.601 --> 04:47.398
Who are you to Miss Rorec?!

04:47.469 --> 04:48.231
Who are you to her?!

04:48.304 --> 04:50.397
Now, now. Just relax.

04:51.607 --> 04:53.700
Are you all right, Rumina?

04:54.910 --> 04:56.844
These underground women
are scary.

05:10.793 --> 05:12.124
Very impressive.

05:12.261 --> 05:16.163
You have a skill worthy
of a Master Warrior.

05:16.565 --> 05:20.865
However, you mustn't get
overconfident about your power.

05:21.704 --> 05:25.731
That's what I should be saying to you!

05:29.678 --> 05:31.441
Thunderclap Fissure!

05:35.084 --> 05:40.920
So, why is it that everyone's
looking for Chelsea?

05:42.291 --> 05:43.223
Well, uh...

05:43.459 --> 05:46.622
W-Well, I'm sure this is
all a mistake.

05:46.695 --> 05:52.099
There's no way that Miss Rorec
would defy the Company!

05:53.035 --> 05:55.629
That's a pretty fishy excuse.

05:56.405 --> 05:59.841
But we came on this mission
precisely because...

05:59.908 --> 06:02.308
...we wanted to find out the truth.

06:03.846 --> 06:08.112
You still believe in the Company,
given all that's happened?

06:09.685 --> 06:11.312
Yes, of course.

06:11.387 --> 06:13.821
Of course we believe in the Company.

06:15.024 --> 06:16.616
Well, this is great.

06:16.725 --> 06:17.749
Don't you realize...

06:17.826 --> 06:20.386
...that Blondie's in bad shape
because of the Company?

06:22.331 --> 06:23.889
All right, then.

06:24.600 --> 06:28.468
Let's say that
what you're saying is true.

06:28.804 --> 06:30.328
But it is true!

06:31.206 --> 06:33.231
If that's the case...

06:33.308 --> 06:36.277
...there's no way I can tell you
where the Company is.

06:36.345 --> 06:38.973
How do you figure that?!

06:39.314 --> 06:41.782
Now if I were you...

06:41.850 --> 06:44.444
...I suppose I'd wait
until my friend recovers.

06:45.454 --> 06:48.150
Wouldn't that be
the obvious thing to do?

06:48.357 --> 06:50.985
You've got to be kidding.
There isn't time!

06:51.060 --> 06:52.527
I've had enough of this!

06:53.529 --> 06:58.592
Do you think you could've
made it this far by yourself?

06:58.967 --> 07:00.662
With no help from anyone?

07:01.670 --> 07:02.637
Uh, well...

07:03.172 --> 07:07.165
The first thing to do is
wait for Miss Rorec to recover.

07:07.876 --> 07:10.538
You really have no other choice.

07:18.487 --> 07:23.789
Are you sure about this,
Maiden of Life?

07:24.927 --> 07:28.693
If I keep on fighting with this girl...

07:28.764 --> 07:33.963
...there will be yet another person
who will be hurt because of you.

07:36.505 --> 07:37.802
Try to remember.

07:37.873 --> 07:41.274
Try to remember what happened
when you escaped from here.

07:42.177 --> 07:44.407
You hurt the people around you...

07:44.480 --> 07:48.382
...and got those innocent
surface dwellers wrapped up in this.

07:48.450 --> 07:50.042
Haven't you noticed?

07:50.285 --> 07:53.618
This is all your fault!

07:53.689 --> 07:55.281
Why, you!

07:58.393 --> 07:59.417
That's enough.

07:59.728 --> 08:00.524
Huh?

08:01.497 --> 08:03.488
That's enough, Shiel!

08:06.869 --> 08:11.033
Little girls should just stay quiet
and mind their manners.

08:12.241 --> 08:14.903
Don't listen to what Pairon says!

08:16.812 --> 08:17.642
Sis!

08:18.180 --> 08:19.374
I can't take it anymore!

08:19.448 --> 08:22.611
I can't handle seeing people
get hurt because of me!

08:28.724 --> 08:29.520
Listen...

08:31.193 --> 08:33.889
There's nothing
you should feel sad about.

08:34.630 --> 08:36.222
This is no one's fault.

08:36.665 --> 08:39.657
I'm fighting because I want to.

08:41.403 --> 08:45.533
Even the crazy-haired guy,
and the blonde girl...

08:45.607 --> 08:47.768
I'm sure it's the same with them.

08:47.843 --> 08:48.775
So...

08:51.513 --> 08:56.007
So you should do what
you yourself want to do.

09:07.095 --> 09:08.528
Run, sis!

09:19.508 --> 09:20.236
What?!

09:25.214 --> 09:25.942
Hurry!

09:32.788 --> 09:33.777
Little bitch...

09:45.200 --> 09:47.168
You're not getting away.

09:54.176 --> 09:58.840
It looks like it won't be possible
for both of us to escape.

10:02.150 --> 10:03.640
I'll take care of things here.

10:04.453 --> 10:06.182
You escape alone.

10:06.588 --> 10:07.384
No.

10:07.456 --> 10:09.117
You have to come with me, Shiel!

10:10.058 --> 10:12.925
If you keep going straight,
you'll come to a small railway.

10:13.228 --> 10:16.061
If you follow the track...

10:16.131 --> 10:17.189
...you'll get to an elevator that...

10:17.266 --> 10:18.460
No!

10:20.302 --> 10:21.098
No...

10:21.870 --> 10:24.896
After I run away,
what are you going to do?

10:26.074 --> 10:28.941
I thought we were going to
live together on the surface.

10:30.412 --> 10:30.878
I'm sorry.

10:31.980 --> 10:33.208
I can't do that now.

10:37.319 --> 10:39.685
Please don't look so sad.

10:42.157 --> 10:43.089
Don't worry.

10:44.126 --> 10:46.219
I'll come after you later.

10:59.875 --> 11:04.812
I'll want my ribbons back.

11:10.018 --> 11:12.350
Sorry to interrupt your little chat.

11:12.621 --> 11:15.784
But I've had enough
of this childishness.

11:18.193 --> 11:19.956
Go, sis.

11:26.535 --> 11:28.400
A shield of thunder...

11:29.771 --> 11:30.430
Shiel...

11:37.512 --> 11:38.638
It's a promise.

11:58.066 --> 11:59.590
Thunder Wall Formation.

12:00.535 --> 12:04.027
I didn't know thunder users
had such a power.

12:04.106 --> 12:05.903
A new and improved version.

12:07.509 --> 12:09.875
All the energy in the shield...

12:09.945 --> 12:13.506
...instantaneously goes
to where it's touched.

12:13.749 --> 12:15.307
Rather than cover myself...

12:15.384 --> 12:18.979
...it's possible to shield a large
space with very little power.

12:19.888 --> 12:21.321
Then, I suppose...

12:23.458 --> 12:26.018
My first priority should be to
wipe you out.

12:28.029 --> 12:28.723
He's fast!

12:39.107 --> 12:40.938
This time it's my turn!

12:43.345 --> 12:45.336
Heaven's Wrath!

12:54.489 --> 12:58.892
Even you, Pairon, can't beat me.

12:58.960 --> 12:59.824
What?

13:00.162 --> 13:02.790
You should've realized that
from your last attack.

13:02.898 --> 13:06.265
That if you don't target your attacks,
you'll short-circuit yourself.

13:06.735 --> 13:09.568
Water cannot beat electricity.

13:09.704 --> 13:11.399
Everyone knows that.

13:13.942 --> 13:16.069
Then, let's test out your theory.

13:17.345 --> 13:19.609
And if you're wrong, you die!

13:21.416 --> 13:22.405
Of course.

13:23.518 --> 13:24.917
Make no mistake!

13:32.627 --> 13:34.356
Thunderball!

13:34.930 --> 13:36.625
Take that!

13:55.116 --> 13:57.311
What do you think?
Taking a direct hit...

14:02.691 --> 14:03.589
Wha...?!

14:33.321 --> 14:35.812
What are you sulking about?

14:45.700 --> 14:48.794
If you don't speak up,
how am I to know?

14:53.308 --> 14:55.139
If you share it with me...

14:55.210 --> 14:57.576
...your sorrows will fade...

14:57.646 --> 15:00.114
...and your happiness will grow.

15:02.117 --> 15:04.779
Really, Chelsea?

15:05.820 --> 15:06.514
Yes.

15:06.922 --> 15:07.889
Of course.

15:25.640 --> 15:27.938
Don't look so sad.

15:30.278 --> 15:34.044
Don't worry.
I'll come after you later.

15:37.352 --> 15:39.582
I understand what Shiel
was saying.

15:40.221 --> 15:43.452
But this is so hard to do
on my own.

15:50.498 --> 15:51.692
But I'm...

15:54.235 --> 15:55.099
Not alone.

16:00.141 --> 16:02.336
How...
How can you still be alive?!

16:08.149 --> 16:09.810
Thunderclap Fissure!

16:13.655 --> 16:15.145
What's the matter?

16:15.423 --> 16:20.258
Didn't you say that a water user
couldn't beat a thunder user?

16:20.629 --> 16:21.653
Why, you!

16:41.516 --> 16:43.746
My thunder didn't work.

16:44.519 --> 16:45.315
Why?

16:46.321 --> 16:48.050
You want to know why?

16:50.558 --> 16:53.425
Why your thunder did not work?

16:55.530 --> 16:56.895
Purity of water.

16:58.667 --> 16:59.861
H2O.

17:00.235 --> 17:03.398
Water that's close to pure H2O...

17:03.471 --> 17:06.565
Water that contains
no impurities...

17:06.641 --> 17:09.701
...is more resistant to your power
and gives me better insulation.

17:10.378 --> 17:15.042
Your power is neutralized
by the purity of my water.

17:15.717 --> 17:18.515
No matter how much you try,
you will not...

17:19.888 --> 17:20.582
Oh?

17:21.189 --> 17:22.986
You can still move?

17:24.359 --> 17:25.951
I cannot lose to you.

17:27.228 --> 17:31.358
I promised my sister
that we'd be together again!

17:43.712 --> 17:48.149
Shiel, I'll stay close to you.

17:49.884 --> 17:52.375
I'll be like your older sister.

17:55.256 --> 17:57.281
I'll take you to him.

17:57.525 --> 17:59.322
To the wind user.

18:04.766 --> 18:07.030
Keep going, sis.

18:31.493 --> 18:32.926
I'm impressed.

18:34.062 --> 18:37.395
Just for an instant, you struck me
with a thunder strike...

18:37.465 --> 18:39.797
...more powerful than
my pure water.

18:43.271 --> 18:44.829
I can't breathe...

18:45.840 --> 18:47.501
I'm sure you know.

18:48.176 --> 18:52.772
That the human body
is made up of about 80% water.

18:53.815 --> 18:54.577
No way...!

18:56.284 --> 19:01.449
What if I could freely manipulate
the water in your body?

19:01.656 --> 19:05.285
That's beyond anyone's power!

19:07.395 --> 19:09.022
What do you know?

19:10.131 --> 19:12.258
Why did you take the Maiden?

19:12.700 --> 19:13.359
Tell me!

19:16.838 --> 19:20.365
I can't let you sacrifice my sister...

19:20.441 --> 19:23.274
...so you can carry out
your sick revenge plot!

19:28.082 --> 19:29.106
I see.

19:29.617 --> 19:31.915
So you overheard
that conversation.

19:33.521 --> 19:36.513
But there's one thing
you're misunderstanding.

19:37.492 --> 19:42.361
You think we'll use the power of the
Maiden to take revenge on the surface?

19:42.430 --> 19:43.488
I don't think so.

19:44.432 --> 19:47.765
I do not require
the power of the Maiden...

19:47.836 --> 19:51.795
...because of some petty
need for vengeance.

19:53.775 --> 19:56.972
Pairon, what are you up to?

19:57.912 --> 20:01.348
It's all right.
She's just a little girl.

20:01.983 --> 20:04.645
There's no way
she can escape them.

20:05.620 --> 20:06.985
Escape who?!

20:07.121 --> 20:09.521
Who got through my defenses?!

20:10.225 --> 20:14.161
Maybe you should be
more worried about yourself right now.

20:20.702 --> 20:23.796
I have no use for a traitor like you.

20:28.243 --> 20:29.505
Good-bye.

20:44.325 --> 20:49.228
Again, I walk the streets today

20:49.297 --> 20:55.202
As if I have a purpose

20:55.270 --> 21:07.740
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.349 --> 21:19.248
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.327 --> 21:31.432
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.639 --> 21:40.638
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.715 --> 21:44.344
I tried to listen

21:44.419 --> 21:52.451
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.527 --> 22:01.265
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.378 --> 22:12.278
Preview

22:12.347 --> 22:13.405
Damn.

22:13.481 --> 22:15.915
I don't have time to be
messing around here.

22:16.217 --> 22:17.275
I've got to...

22:17.352 --> 22:19.946
I've got to get Ruri back!

22:20.621 --> 22:22.851
Wh-What's that
feeling I'm getting?

22:23.358 --> 22:24.825
The top of that tower...

22:25.259 --> 22:28.717
I don't know what's going on,
but I feel like...

22:28.796 --> 22:30.957
I feel like I've got to go there!

22:31.833 --> 22:34.267
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.335 --> 22:36.204
..."The Assassins of Tower Gate."

22:36.204 --> 22:37.138
The Assassins of Tower Gate
..."The Assassins of Tower Gate."

22:37.138 --> 22:40.232
The Assassins of Tower Gate
